      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9f861302de0f0ec5d29bf6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "束起光芒的纯白缎带……真可爱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8e22db97f97408be22ec8165c23ce7ff78098350ded47214e19dd7aad7ab7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60b191a2a98880fecb4645f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "志愿奉仕活动似乎会变得很有趣呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f358aef3577dc78d7f9e1a91f308865baa5e62af014ec022db9028ba1abe2dcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a15f08c40338b8dff1855ab5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，看来精灵也很中意呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f8a28fba13d20e69667cbb52324bfc4b0ad12e0e6c036899998129e4c4a51b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40e5d403166386261feeb2c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:353d55bc127360972ad82916",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘘……听到了。那试图唤醒我的\r\n崇高之声。\r\n这声是，喔……喔……喔喔喔——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c3f1d519013608fbe3d5a98050241fc28a965f57e8531b3742f10e29b2a168c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05d4701b381ef3b874f660b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊……啊，抱歉！昨晚\r\n不小心看异世界转生小说太入迷了……\r\n没想到勇者竟然是亲姐姐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e022485335d580dfc68c13f656cf55393e9f56b86b3dabc20dfd107c2d0dcf6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:467a860b123b9168b1647f2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迎接试炼的良机到来了。\r\n来吧！今天在食堂\r\n要挑战几级辣度的咖喱呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "853c74c292be33c29870a161a49f25a94a33ba60b36ca4d303c00da9e729cdfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ad1720b263d4f099cc46197",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……呵呵。方才得到的神谕说\r\n能遇上贵人。\r\n果然应验了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "942338f7d6933d3c414b43fc5aeb4cd2289b63b093dab6f138fed3b35e5584b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb415dba086f656e8746fdfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暗夜令人无助，徒增不安……\r\n您什么都不必说，没关系的。\r\n就由我的光芒来温暖您吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea795f2e0f9cec1d3011af87d54a4132a13cb54e43c1792d3fb623d1bf0c09e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42c1e823ffef81c2ff1fecb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我悄悄溜出房间，向繁星祈祷着。\r\n愿爱律同学能够在目标赛事中\r\n如愿以偿……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a52b6efd91434373a8cb095cd47fffb5253cb46400e594230d33ccafa85acbf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca82a7b241d4f690475c72e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是新作迭出的季节。小说、漫画、\r\n动画……净是些精彩的转生故事，\r\n教人哪还有空闲去睡春觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c046e594d41b68a1c479fe760259e5414cc3adfb11fb6608f6499d0d9513974f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f0f8d12da13d87e4d441da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "酷暑连绵不绝呢……不，这亦是\n一种试炼！是降下神旨命我\n平息烈日的狂暴……包在我身上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b8d0e50a2c06742fcd14abdc262ba5b997a24ec7439f97920d2b464db643308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b203bb9fe13aa9f9801d1588",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦～噜啦啦啦～～…♪呵呵呵，\r\n以虫鸣为伴奏哼唱赞歌。\r\n欢快的时节终于到来了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9260ae5c3f933bc479cdd8cb3d482b3e2a52e3a592935cd6c233f92c4c233999",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ca09eb300e15c6067066a27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请用这杯肉桂满满的咖啡，\r\n温暖您的身与心吧。\r\n由咖啡同学亲传，味道绝对有保证♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8254b4151f4f59e157a99d1cb7fb5849e65ce30faf0a313db231363b2fa86ca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab494d6bbea9b5e6ca3207cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "献上情人节的祝福……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a811bf2dcf3467605c3f07321bea57bc2fabfe202f9a207f2f76eb48558addaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1479e2f6809840a62e445377",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "数学补习的参加者只有我一人……正是\r\n深入潜心求学的好机会！\r\n这份启示，我必好好加以活用！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b4b47fff7de118e6833f537d5908614c068a0c5d34a597e4ead825fbbdefb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a636c039261b3b05db800bb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向景致同学安利转生题材大获成功。\n她似乎格外中意心动恋爱向……\n必须尽快借给她看才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "252a0b25a788c2d0d15f27f52e577b2966de8966654d91b428b886744f5bfcdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e605efd07c967e441f51f80f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就连指尖的动作，拉拉同学的一举一动\n都有如圣女般优雅美丽……太棒了！\n真希望能向她请教一番。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c01efff491ee2b6acc77ad923a3b30fe9ad6704f24ed351cc5f823d2d39d528e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d43fa65c5bf2cdff55558d8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊～～……穿BDC决胜服的\r\n伏特加，真是令人大饱眼福啊……\r\n感谢这番天赐之福！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b876ab9d3b64c798648b8c4a9912c9512dde3932060c8a434b25c820ada79b44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:639c037afa37f6a4c6821a4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "声线与咖啡中透出的，茶座同学那份\n温柔的深邃……我也想学会呢。\n首先……要从获取咖啡豆的知识开始吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8aadd6c3fe7a3ef4dc228272047155c85a3ba95134a1f163b6e193b4d673d4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:098eba2bc24ad5891e73df95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……轻触项圈，\r\n然后变出星之法杖，这样如何呢？\r\n嗯，作为圣女专属定制去提交申请吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e45f4189d7266059fd3ab20cb05823d16b161e9ec169834cf509630ef63ea76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13073d4b58f61775c40376bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在前几天的演出中，后排右侧的那位观众\r\n面带郁色呢……我必须刻苦钻研，\r\n为大家带来治愈的时光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae944edbd6923b3d13f94770966db5517bfead775501f7480cf2cf1304b01664",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838b0c8872faaf97cb26f744",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决胜服的赤红，代表着耐受灼身业火的\r\n坚韧意志……无论多么残酷的\r\n试炼，我都绝不屈服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bf947c1a63283797c9a23eb2a09dda6cb1dce05906f931eac2310d36c32cc95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9436ba52bb51f18f10c36851",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晴朗的夜晚，我便身着这身衣裳在天台\r\n献上祈祷。为了吸纳星辰之力，\r\n备战赛事……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c1c3e2c06f5adb1e25f549cb495020027f6f8a725fba09b5f28dd4d6c800402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:affb51efbfea9aabbb049235",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心中想着对方的笑颜……这是景致同学\n教我的便当制作秘诀。\n我这就去志愿奉仕活动中分给大家品尝♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "821565e638fa17ccfe3265cc5b2f23d6b0fd17ced3c82c08f7a8cfe1d1493bd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cf196027497ecbcf4d0d519",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给创升同学带的点心，\n就决定是限量版巧克力了……这样\n才配得上伏特加的新情报嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cad43cab20e4828cf37c7f65a61fe43390f20533433bf7cd3e8393648163f3be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceb7b1507b469f3caa212f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘘……这是精灵也已安睡的时间。\r\n此刻何不与我一同仰望群星，\r\n静静地献上祈祷呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cd97c5e051e33731de79a5e3f227f7c1aef4e5c0ce71cfb1ba799c3297c08e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:021dd7ba5b846a66a5a863a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "苍天啊……屋檐下鸟巢中的鸟蛋，\r\n还请您务必守护。并赐予它们\r\n茁壮生命的律动吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "471347192c409ae32525aa815ec7e067e14c4cde4b675ba66a5f8e57fadf08e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec725761820b7d662d0d6ffe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "何等恶毒的滚滚热浪……\r\n为了让大家能平安度日，\r\n在太阳听从前我都会一直祈祷的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3585c386222040535747a8fcc6d8a7bf4f64f6682362c5ae168795c631d0d1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:115f3780dbcb30ea23099782",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明已经有相似的款式了……可是那件\r\n复古风的秋季新款连衣裙……\r\n呜……在我脑海中……挥之不去……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f702644cc6b42c7f5534f0605a513852610d5a36b11b266f73541b88963ba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d82325e9925c30667246a4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，何等罪孽深重的季节……！\r\n法式蔬菜炖肉……炖菜……我到底该\r\n先对哪里的胡萝卜下嘴才好！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8998f407872878bd6bf4bd6eb775a355ea7265d15184c0b79f85ffd2a14d4005",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c491201ebdfd42e79a3523be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仰卧起坐、坡道冲刺、拉轮胎。\r\n无论是怎样的试炼都无妨。\r\n我将怀抱神圣之火，逐一跨越！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ca467f3778759274c8d862ca0fd0b7fc280526e6cb8e8e915236829cc939b72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b99a14034d61eca1688d285c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们从祈祷开始吧。\r\n愿大家今天也能平平安安地\r\n进行锻炼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "02827b2af1aadf24f05166117526bcb7299c710d7219f17ba3091e225e57692d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98e929e00b8238577753a49e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请务必将您那出类拔萃的指导力\r\n传授于我！\r\n我将用它作为救赎迷途之人的食粮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "475fdcaea6723ade6e49a504b0f3e7aa2e8c9e7547c98f67010d35384218c2c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:968e49d4d1ffe5a1c97b0a84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真正的邪恶，乃是潜伏于己身的阴影。\r\n傲慢与诱惑皆当摒弃，\r\n我定会成为一名真正的圣女！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20182a1c327f8fc866ddaf477940cca2392d7cd236e516c05f3bf7a64a10e976",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c741789c3c98433e4983957b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若能抵达异界，\r\n纵然纵身跃入业火我也在所不惜。\r\n请您相信我，注视着我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d1ebb2dc22143764f86bc55520f7c52b91e90bb68d4e7c02c38b94c0859e6b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:785e1208bb101921694aad30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是灾患重重的锻炼，还是严苛无情的锻炼……\r\n无论哪一种，我都坚信您\r\n会将我引向正途。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f05a9e97a623604ac1a8bb90b601d5862dd8339b823156ba8a0673510d7a0a81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c20ff1ef57de4dc37283cbd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "于世人而言的救赎是我。\r\n而于我而言的救赎……则是您。\r\n感谢这场相遇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fdbd681d5895c36a0851a9e8eb5f155ef31234e91d0dd9768749a89f46a257b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84be5f73c6af29836882722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "炽日狂烈的恩宠，瀚海浩瀚的慈爱……\r\n呜呼，玛娜正在满溢……！\r\n请赐予我更多、更多吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d452a7f0b71b148ffb2668bdbfa54d11962465b426a3480a3ca6a48684f12b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbbc58cb48b204cd6cb64ceb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的救赎，尊贵之人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "63246c42c6a7527d6e3526ba3a383d91a56690c77d63a9e194b81b1d2f04b04a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7092b36b3284d73449d88384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢您的指引。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fd98b96ac098998cb993bc94ad5d904cd92f7e3143d4b1a4f7d1b359e3c7668",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5cc2fe30b280001120005c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又向真正的圣女迈近了一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d605fb24573e8633aa82e608f564eafb0fa893a08a1621e9bbe10575dc932d69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8dd880516463dd8334f4e0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，祈祷传达到了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c063b3661ab71560e2c3bda273f3ead690db4c3c2cc10ecc744d53a84815db1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ffde3bcf500a0e76e0a284e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在，我是圣女红色梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8740208d65119617841145d30aad9272ebfc2dd30a9b7658046dc59db73e4a62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ac741891c1347042bd1bc51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正是圣女——\r\n抵达异界、普渡众生之引导者！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d2ad66132516c064591d2a16e15c796ccd1d638ccd1ea8fafa3678f5d4bb3b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6ab84aaabf8d25352b09007",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，我感受到了这份祝福……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1abe076962eeb99994beea972a1e236585b7bb2ee242412be0246ffdd4582bb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b06553fd2b00d732f23850",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃烧灵魂吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6846dad93f42057268ccf63695969cbbf6fa646e5ee71bd5310467eb45a72e0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70dc07b5f8ae42865b8fc27e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么你总是对我抱有那么多的\r\n期待呢……呜——我当然会\r\n回应你的啦，那是肯定的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f435bfc40745c5cb4a2e7547ab1a9cd096162280936fb8765f947ec3e0b8033",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d92275a6b4ed3370bb2bc9e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a81719318f354a289fa32effff3e0060c6af596527f262f806d5f1b7f27b877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab5791d61b4c15136bd19f56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcca0a999319539ad9640b8787eee70f6962f780c51356ce460851b0dce71db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ad733a8d94841738b56df6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要去看看漫画改编的舞台剧？\r\n……我觉得如果是和你一起去的话，\r\n一定会是一次愉快的体验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4178b17350d67ec34dd39361b92f261ab995315fcdbabdffde165ae0652a8ca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b485cf9045f14c1e9b27e2a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次可以COS一下敌方组织的杀手吗？\n就是穿着金闪闪的西装，\n还带着刺刺护肩的那种！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0016baacc2c4cdcbf172de6803e80ddafac6f7cf4b3ec3e14d63922a9488bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92935574bfea4e7510d28d59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新·章·突·入！\r\n带着全新的必杀技，展现出与\r\n更加强大的强敌战斗的身姿吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c0e35668f2a6785f1a7e80c9db49469a932f6d27cca14aa42af2ff2dc98e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0efbeb6f6364de26f1f724f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，要不要去看看储物柜？\r\n谁柜子里有巧克力谁就算赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85e7bfe258da2cab22360f9bf4eb92dfaa89ffe3f262f68193b35970964dc628",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a4c2a4c3c79fbdfd066840c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请用纸杯蛋糕！哼……这可是注入了\r\n常人无法承受之『念』的佳作……\r\n你能全部吃完吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f71a9ff6fc22a82be566550dde8adac8f9cb7c4e119ff8116fcd47a3ae23eeda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93b6dde9125437f0c06f2282",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果想要跨越银河，只要张开想象的翅膀\r\n飞翔就好。只要愿望足够强烈，\r\n哪怕是银河的彼端也一定能到达！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccddc22838bcd08fa0ebc841726b836824b74e6b29196278d01d7aafe53818f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:635a380822a7113c8d6b661d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "满大街都是各种作品的COS呢……\r\n总有一天，我的作品也一定能\r\n名列其中……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a51cd038a0840a09106a7cd5e57ea7cc8e651024a4eff5a1bab01a5c8e914141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46ac2b4f220343c897a292cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我要去参加气槽前辈主持的\r\n派对！有蛋糕还有桌游，\r\n好期待呀～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a91a215e1790c0505a9451a6dbcb72fc19218ca050019ecc3a86b434e8cee1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5eb19340a08d88fa86176cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前收到的画具套装，现在是不是\r\n还在抽屉里呢。久违地试用一下吧……\r\n那盒20色的蜡笔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "971c745c1ff38db2be7187f6aad0a5f79fb0aefda2544018e28d124d103e3d5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:198c9203ca0a7b32f0f00659",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe7548f6a96c3ffbb15ebb1881687fdb27f8c9371c23aa3dfef656a536ac829",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef33a332864ca498542a6c60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有好多仅限年内免费畅读的内容……！\r\n手机、平板还有电脑……\r\n全部用上的话应该能看完！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a5f953a864c58f3b377c0321d3c28d45717de1a8433b8c96352049f42b64c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcd61eed9c9389a6f905d30d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了庆祝生日我做了『漫画肉』哦♪\r\n用了专门的骨头，在大小、魄力\r\n还有画力表现上都非常讲究呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a17ab6035642c7cb3d777b8c66b0d00a0f24f24461a2a8c966120c9a208f4e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b97ac4ef0b9d8d3603d9f34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要打篮球吗？还是要进行异能战斗？\r\n或者是料理对决？今天你才是\r\n主人公！无论什么我都会陪你的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "258709579de3f8759e2ad7898dd2582c6db5f4eb225ec61a47b55df22f604d83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4bf40323b0af0e45eb083b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给明年的自己，写一封信吧……\r\n——现在的你，\r\n有没有比当时离梦想更近一步了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8a95f486be27b92fb75232861d70d8f4520cfe9a4131e5e5598d9e9f8ef47c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10013"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
